  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "At the moment there is no method to find out if your avatar is performing a blink.\n\nIt would be really useful to have a Bool (desynced) that lets the animator know if a blink is being performed to allow for blinking to only happen via the animator \n\n(or to suppress certain activities/animations when a blink is in progress)",
